{"product":{"id":8879533523180,"title":"Cortech Cobra Can Trash Receptacle","body_html":"\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eCortech Cobra Can Trash Receptacle\u003c\/strong\u003e is a virtually unbreakable trash can for correctional facilities, behavioral healthcare facilities, kitchens, and other high-abuse settings. It comes in nine sizes, in either Flame Retardant or Food Grade Material for food service or general applications. The can is rotationally molded from structural polyethylene for strength with some flexibility. Molded-in handles run around the entire can and its underside for easier lifting, and molded-in floor glides reduce floor scratching when the can is dragged.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Rotationally molded structural polyethylene; 0.22” nominal wall thickness\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20, 22, 25, 30, 35, 40, 45, 50, or 55 gallons\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Flame retardant or food grade and general use\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHandles:\u003c\/strong\u003e 360° molded-in continuous handles around the entire can perimeter and underside\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFloor Glides:\u003c\/strong\u003e Molded-in floor glides reduce floor scratching when the can is dragged\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDurability:\u003c\/strong\u003e Virtually unbreakable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlame Retardant Version:\u003c\/strong\u003e Passes California Technical Bulletin 133 and UL 94 HB; tested to ISO 22196, showing a greater than 99% reduction in bacteria\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eColors:\u003c\/strong\u003e Flame retardant in Blue Gray (also available in Green or Blue); food grade and general use in Blue, Green, Red, White, Yellow, or Black (custom colors available on request)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eDolly:\u003c\/strong\u003e Optional Cobra Can dolly, sold separately\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWarranty:\u003c\/strong\u003e 10-year factory warranty\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCountry of Manufacture:\u003c\/strong\u003e USA, made to ISO quality standards\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Models and Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFlame Retardant, Blue Gray:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20200FR, 22200FR, 25200FR, 30200FR, 35200FR, 40200FR, 45200FR, 50200FR, and 55200FR (20 to 55 gallons)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFood Grade and General Use, Blue:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20620B, 22620B, 25620B, 30620B, 35620B, 40620B, 45620B, 50620B, and 55620B (20 to 55 gallons)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFood Grade and General Use, Green:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20720G, 22720G, 25720G, 30720G, 35720G, 40720G, 45720G, 50720G, and 55720G (20 to 55 gallons)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFood Grade and General Use, Red:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20584R, 22584R, 25584R, 30584R, 35584R, 40584R, 45584R, 50584R, and 55584R (20 to 55 gallons)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFood Grade and General Use, White:\u003c\/strong\u003e 202W, 222W, 252W, 302W, 352W, 402W, 452W, 502W, and 552W (20 to 55 gallons)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFood Grade and General Use, Yellow:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20451Y, 22451Y, 25451Y, 30451Y, 35451Y, 40451Y, 45451Y, 50451Y, and 55451Y (20 to 55 gallons)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFood Grade and General Use, Black:\u003c\/strong\u003e 20116B, 22116B, 25116B, 30116B, 35116B, 40116B, 45116B, 50116B, and 55116B (20 to 55 gallons)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCobra Can Dolly (optional):\u003c\/strong\u003e DCC for 20 to 30 gallon cans; DCCL for 35 to 55 gallon cans\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eApplications\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Cobra Can suits secure facilities and kitchens that need a trash can that will not break, with a flame retardant version for areas that must meet flammability standards.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eTypical applications include:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHousing units, dayrooms, and common areas in correctional facilities and jails\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eKitchens, dining halls, and food service areas\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBehavioral healthcare facilities and other high-abuse settings\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eExplore Anchortex's \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/janitorial-and-sanitation-supplies\"\u003ePrison Janitorial and Sanitation Supplies\u003c\/a\u003e and \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/prison-and-detention-kitchen-and-food-service-equipment\"\u003ePrison and Detention Kitchen and Food Service Equipment\u003c\/a\u003e collections for more trash receptacles and sanitation supplies.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Cortech Facilities Maintenance\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCortech facilities maintenance products are molded to stand up to hard daily use in correctional facilities, behavioral healthcare facilities, and other high-abuse settings.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCortech facilities maintenance includes:\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eTrash Receptacles:\u003c\/strong\u003e Cobra Cans in 20 to 55 gallon sizes, in flame retardant or food grade and general use material, and Cobra Mini Cans in 10 and 14 quart sizes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCarts:\u003c\/strong\u003e Kangaroo Carts and lids for laundry, trash, and material handling\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSecure Waste Bins:\u003c\/strong\u003e The lockable SafeBin with a 35-gallon inner container\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eAbout Cortech\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCortech manufactures durable molded furniture for demanding environments, including behavioral healthcare facilities, psychiatric hospitals, correctional institutions, law enforcement facilities, and homeless and emergency shelters. Explore the full line of \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.anchortex.com\/collections\/cortech-usa\"\u003eCortech Behavioral Health and Prison Furniture\u003c\/a\u003e at Anchortex.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Cortech","product_type":"","created_at":"2025-04-16T13:38:37-04:00","handle":"cortech-cobra-can-trash-receptacle","updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:16:14-05:00","published_at":"2025-04-16T13:38:38-04:00","template_suffix":null,"published_scope":"web","tags":"cortech-kitchen-food-service, cortech-usa, kitchen-food-service, prison-janitorial, prison-janitorial-trash-cans","variants":[{"id":46374571311340,"product_id":8879533523180,"title":"20200FR - Flame Retardant - 20 gal - Gray","price":"289.60","sku":"C601095","position":1,"compare_at_price":"362.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"20200FR - Flame Retardant - 20 gal - Gray","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2025-04-16T13:38:37-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:16:14-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":null,"grams":115666,"image_id":null,"weight":255.0,"weight_unit":"lb","requires_shipping":true,"quantity_rule":{"min":1,"max":null,"increment":1},"price_currency":"USD","compare_at_price_currency":"USD","quantity_price_breaks":[]},{"id":46374571344108,"product_id":8879533523180,"title":"22200FR - Flame Retardant - 22 gal - Gray","price":"289.60","sku":"C601095","position":2,"compare_at_price":"362.00","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"22200FR - Flame Retardant - 22 gal - Gray","option2":null,"option3":null,"created_at":"2025-04-16T13:38:37-04:00","updated_at":"2026-11-20T16:16:14-05:00","taxable"